    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swordmancy is a survivor game where the player controls a Swordmancer, warriors capables of controlling living weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You defeat enemies, get the experience and choose one out of three random upgrade as you level up. Once you get an upgrade to level 8, you can evolve the weapon  to get an even more powerful version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you defeat bosses, complete events and evolve weapons, you will unlock more characters, weapons and upgrades. You can try every single one of them and unlock more and more elements in your collection!\u00a0</p>",
